forever/db.lua
forever/features.lua
forever/profiles.lua
## The aura tracker's host: the store under CamelotDB.global, the editor
## window's position and the two saved-key tokens, which the shared files in
## the component block read at the moment of use. Before
## forever/components.lua, which reads the category for its Features row at
## file scope.
forever/auras/host.lua
forever/recolor.lua

## Quality of Life shared with Scoot (docs/qualityoflife/qualityoflife.md).
## host.lua is addon.QoLHost, the store every file below reads through; it
## stands on forever/db.lua above and comes first, because qol.lua reads a
## setting while it loads (OnAddonLoaded runs at once for a Blizzard addon
## already loaded, as after a /reload). The nudge arrows and the sub-grid
## stand on editmode/persist (SaveOnly) and LibEditMode; qol (repair, grey
## selling, faster loot, the quest log count, map coordinates) and smallfixes
## (modifier click targeting) on secretsafe, events and fonts. smallfixes
## loads before forever/unitframes/harness.lua, which registers a click
## refresher with it at file scope.
forever/qualityoflife/host.lua
core/editmode/nudgearrows.lua
core/editmode/subgrid.lua
core/qol.lua
core/smallfixes.lua

## Dynamic Layouts: resolver publishes base-or-dynamic edges; tween is the
## OnUpdate driver; engine holds the adapter registry and reads the store seam
## at call time; view is the state behind the dynamic view of Edit Mode, which
## ui/v2/editmode/DynamicView.lua draws. The host, forever/dynamiclayouts/
## host.lua, follows forever/components.lua below so its Features row lists
## after Minimap and Tooltip. Stands on events, commands, debug/core,
## editmode/positionables, profiles/core and forever/db.lua above. No
## game-type gate: retail runs the engine with zero adapters.
core/dynamiclayouts/resolver.lua
core/dynamiclayouts/tween.lua
core/dynamiclayouts/engine.lua
core/dynamiclayouts/view.lua

## The component system, shared, and its host. base/core holds registration,
## the settings table behind component.db and the apply pass; the host answers
## that table from forever/db.lua through addon.ComponentStore and owns the
## module gate (docs/sharing.md, "The seams"). The host registers Features rows
## at file scope, so it precedes forever/menu.lua. The component after it
## registers an initializer at file scope and runs on both clients. The
## minimap left this block 11 October 2026 for the replica under
## forever/minimap/ below; Scoot.toc still lists the X component.
core/components/base/core.lua
## Icon borders on a component's icons; reads ComponentsUtil at file scope.
core/components/base/iconborders.lua
forever/components.lua
