## The Personal Resource Display: Forever's PRD on a Camelot-owned frame
## (docs/personalresourcedisplay/replica.md). style.lua holds the module, its
## switch, its settings and the apply, and loads on retail too for the page
## below, like forever/objectivetracker/style.lua; mixins.lua defines the
## global frames.xml names in a mixin= attribute, so it precedes the XML;
## frames.xml declares the frame from Blizzard's XML under Camelot names, with
## no Blizzard template inherited; display.lua feeds the bars from the player
## unit, parks Blizzard's frame and registers /camelot prd; editmode.lua the
## positionable and the dialog mirror; dynamic.lua the Dynamic Layouts
## adapter; castbar.lua the cast bar on the display, one more row on the cast
## bar engine above with a look and a painter of its own and the seams a
## hosted row needs; combopoints.lua the combo point row, the unit frames'
## row in a line under the frame. Stands on nativeframe, events, strata, colors, fonts,
## borders, barborders, editmode/positionables, dynamiclayouts/engine,
## forever/db.lua, forever/features.lua, forever/profiles.lua, the unit
## frames' values.lua, healprediction.lua and combopoints.lua above, and the
## cast bars' files.
